{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52733","headline":"丹元子步天歌 西方七宿 一 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 西方七宿 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奎，腰细头尖似破鞋。\n一十六星遶鞋生，外屏七乌奎下横。\n屏下七星天溷明，司空左畔土之精。\n奎上一宿军南门，河中六个阁道形。\n附路一星傍道明，五个吐花王良星，良星近上一策名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}